{
  "title": "Quick German Oats Fritter",
  "description": "Peppery, crunchy, and easy to make, this German-inspired oats fritter is a quick-fix breakfast or snack option. Serve with a dollop of yogurt or a side of fruit for a delightful treat.",
  "cuisine": "german",
